                                                "sense_id": "78814af1-ea28-397b-bf4e-6ffb8b31a0b4",
                                                "text": "If the Randall Thompson Alleluia lacked the otherworldly awe and mystery the composer intended, the BGMC offered a fair accounting of the work with some wonderfully hushed pianissimos and clearly delineated contrasts in mood."
                                            }
